{"id": "t126-060", "text": "nora said her husband's firm is closing the dublin office so they might have to move. nothing decided yet. she's stressed obviously, they just bought the house in feb and their son just started at the local primary. she asked me to keep an ear out for any jobs going at ours for him, he's a quantity surveyor", "spans": [{"id": "p1", "type": "PERSON", "text": "nora", "pronoun": "she"}, {"id": "r1", "type": "RELATION", "text": "husband", "owner": "p1"}, {"id": "e1", "type": "EVENT", "text": "closing the dublin office", "event_type": "job", "followup": "ask_outcome", "owner": "r1"}, {"id": "f1", "type": "FACT", "text": "stressed", "fact_type": "feeling", "owner": "p1"}, {"id": "e2", "type": "EVENT", "text": "bought the house", "event_type": "move", "followup": "none", "owner": "p1"}, {"id": "d1", "type": "DATE", "text": "in feb", "anchor": "e2"}, {"id": "r2", "type": "RELATION", "text": "son", "owner": "p1"}, {"id": "e3", "type": "EVENT", "text": "started at the local primary", "event_type": "school", "followup": "ask_outcome", "owner": "r2"}, {"id": "a1", "type": "ACTION", "text": "keep an ear out for any jobs going at ours for him", "action_type": "other", "timing": "unspecified", "owner": "r1", "anchor": "e1"}, {"id": "f2", "type": "FACT", "text": "quantity surveyor", "fact_type": "job", "owner": "r1"}]}
